  "derivation": "Foundation 22 XNA exception cluster. The original XNA 4.0 Windows assemblies were located on this host by exact SHA-256 and disassembled with ikdasm; tools/api_compat/reference/XNA_IL_PROVENANCE.md pins them and tools/api_compat/build_il_inventory.rb derives docs/generated/xna-il-inventory.json from them without reproducing any Microsoft-owned bytes. Contract rows are read from that inventory and from the pinned public metadata: every XNA exception type declares zero fields, zero non-constructor methods, and constructors whose whole IL body is a pure forward to the CLR exception base. Mapping rows are derived from that fact applied to the documented StandardError base mapping; neither is snapshotted from the cna-ruby implementation.",
